  "releaseNotes": "v1.6.0: Comprehensive XML documentation overhaul. Added SIMD feature detection (AVX2/SSE4.1) to all streaming hash implementations. Detailed algorithm explanations with step-by-step inline comments for: MurmurHash3 (32/128), CityHash (64/128), FarmHash64, SpookyHash128, SipHash24, HighwayHash64, MetroHash (64/128), wyhash64, and xxHash (32/64/3/128). 678 tests passing. All APIs now fully documented.",
